                "content": "```\nInput: nums = [5,4,0,3,1,6,2]\nOutput: 4\nExplanation: nums[0] = 5, nums[1] = 4, nums[2] = 0, nums[3] = 3, nums[4] = 1, nums[5] = 6, nums[6] = 2.\nOne of the longest sets s[k]:\ns[0] = {nums[0], nums[5], nums[6], nums[2]} = {5, 6, 2, 0}\n```"
